error: `N` is not a format here
  `N` would put separators between groups of digits, which change from one country to another
  --> error_format_letter_group.sg:4:20
 4 |     print($"{price:N2}")
   |                    ^^
  hint: an integer is written as it is: `{price}`; a fractional number with so many digits after the point: `{price:F2}`
